{"id":"7702f850d0f755f5","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-pullback.md","title":"Pullback","display":"df-pullback — Pullback","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-pullback","aliases":["93-df-pullback"],"display":"df-pullback — Pullback","depends_on":["[[93-df-category]]","[[93-df-morphism]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-pullback"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-pullback</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-pullback — Pullback"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"aa74a8aadef06b6c\" href=\"?note=aa74a8aadef06b6c\" title=\"93-df-category\">93-df-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b3500ab2f8429ba4\" href=\"?note=b3500ab2f8429ba4\" title=\"93-df-morphism\">93-df-morphism</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cat}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\">\\(\\mathrm{Cat}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\)</span>, with object and hom sets <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\">\\(\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}\">\\(\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}\\)</span> as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"aa74a8aadef06b6c\" href=\"?note=aa74a8aadef06b6c\" title=\"93-df-category\">93-df-category</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Mor}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Mor}_{93}\\)</span> (the typed morphism predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b3500ab2f8429ba4\" href=\"?note=b3500ab2f8429ba4\" title=\"93-df-morphism\">93-df-morphism</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:A\\to D\">\\(f:A\\to D\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g:B\\to D\">\\(g:B\\to D\\)</span> (a cospan in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Pullback}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Pullback}_{93}\\)</span> (the pullback predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pullback}\\vdash{}&amp;\\mathrm{Pullback}_{93}(P,p_A,p_B,f,g,A,B,D,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{Cat}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\land A,B,D,P\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Mor}_{93}(f,A,D,\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{Mor}_{93}(g,B,D,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Mor}_{93}(p_A,P,A,\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{Mor}_{93}(p_B,P,B,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land f\\circ_{\\mathcal C}p_A=g\\circ_{\\mathcal C}p_B\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall X\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\\;\\forall x_A\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,A)\\;\\forall x_B\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,B)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\Bigl(f\\circ_{\\mathcal C}x_A=g\\circ_{\\mathcal C}x_B\\to\n\\exists!u\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,P)\\;\n(p_A\\circ_{\\mathcal C}u=x_A\\land p_B\\circ_{\\mathcal C}u=x_B)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pullback}\\vdash{}&amp;\\mathrm{Pullback}_{93}(P,p_A,p_B,f,g,A,B,D,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{Cat}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\land A,B,D,P\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Mor}_{93}(f,A,D,\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{Mor}_{93}(g,B,D,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Mor}_{93}(p_A,P,A,\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{Mor}_{93}(p_B,P,B,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land f\\circ_{\\mathcal C}p_A=g\\circ_{\\mathcal C}p_B\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall X\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\\;\\forall x_A\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,A)\\;\\forall x_B\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,B)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\Bigl(f\\circ_{\\mathcal C}x_A=g\\circ_{\\mathcal C}x_B\\to\n\\exists!u\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,P)\\;\n(p_A\\circ_{\\mathcal C}u=x_A\\land p_B\\circ_{\\mathcal C}u=x_B)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The source, target, cone arrows, and composition law all belong to the same category; the final clause is the pullback universal property.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"aa74a8aadef06b6c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-morphism","status":"resolved","id":"b3500ab2f8429ba4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-morphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"aa74a8aadef06b6c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cat}_{93}(\\mathcal C)$, with object and hom sets $\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}$ and $\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}$ as in [[93-df-category]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-morphism","status":"resolved","id":"b3500ab2f8429ba4","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Mor}_{93}$ (the typed morphism predicate of [[93-df-morphism]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cat}_{93}(\\mathcal C)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Mor}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"f:A\\to D","display":false},{"tex":"g:B\\to D","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Pullback}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pullback}\\vdash{}&\\mathrm{Pullback}_{93}(P,p_A,p_B,f,g,A,B,D,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\\\\\n&\\mathrm{Cat}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\land A,B,D,P\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{Mor}_{93}(f,A,D,\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{Mor}_{93}(g,B,D,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{Mor}_{93}(p_A,P,A,\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{Mor}_{93}(p_B,P,B,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&\\land f\\circ_{\\mathcal C}p_A=g\\circ_{\\mathcal C}p_B\\\\\n&\\land\\forall X\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\\;\\forall x_A\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,A)\\;\\forall x_B\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,B)\\\\\n&\\quad\\Bigl(f\\circ_{\\mathcal C}x_A=g\\circ_{\\mathcal C}x_B\\to\n\\exists!u\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,P)\\;\n(p_A\\circ_{\\mathcal C}u=x_A\\land p_B\\circ_{\\mathcal C}u=x_B)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1533,"backlinks":[{"id":"fbf91595366c330b","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Pullback}_{93}$ (the pullback predicate of [[93-df-pullback]])"},{"id":"dbf8e12e31001be4","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FinSubJoin}_{93}$ and $\\mathrm{Pullback}_{93}$ (see [[93-df-finite-subobject-join]] and [[93-df-pullback]])"},{"id":"9a0e4e3dae0f2467","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["aa74a8aadef06b6c","b3500ab2f8429ba4"]}